    "sections": {
        "description": "Education Empowerment, a child theme of the popular Bizberg WordPress Theme, is widely regarded as the best education WordPress theme 2026 for schools, colleges, universities, training centers, and other educational institutions seeking a professional online presence. This clean and modern free education WordPress theme is ideal for tuition centers, workshops, book-selling platforms, course hubs, blogging, or any kind of learning-focused website. Fully responsive and cross-browser compatible, Education Empowerment ensures a seamless user experience across devices, while its translation-ready and SEO-friendly design helps maximize visibility and reach. Built entirely with Elementor, all sections are easily customizable, enabling administrators to create engaging pages that highlight courses, programs, and learning resources with ease. Extensive documentation and a friendly support team make implementation effortless, making Education Empowerment a reliable, feature-rich, and future-ready solution for educational websites in 2026."
